@AppleSupport Macbook Pro(Early 2015) with recent High Sierra Version Safari is crashing 5-10 sek after start. Not able to work. Re-installed MacOS from the scratch. No impact. Parallely the iCloud music library can’t sync. @115858 please fix! || Hey @AppleSupport ever since i updated to high sierra 2 days ago my screen does this when i shut down pls tell me this is a common occurrence and yall are working to fix it bc this ish makes me nervous as hell https://t.co/uDIej6mGQn || @AppleSupport MacBook Air.2 years old. But never used. Tried to use it first time two weeks ago. Cursor uncontrollable. Service at Mangalore (Maple) says Track PAD defective. RS.10000 for replacement. Quite unfair as it is manufacturing defect.Replace free of cost || @AppleSupport After updating to macOS High Sierra version 10.13.1 I have not been able to connect to my internet router. My other devices that are connected to the same internet work fine. Connecting with a hotspot works. How do I fix the main internet connection? https://t.co/ofjahv1wOR || I've had my MacBook Pro for 7 years, no problems whatsoever. Until 2 weeks ago, I cannot even begin to tell you how many times it's just shut down and needed to restart. 

Called Apple today and they won't help me. Apparently my laptop is vintage!! 

@AppleSupport @115858 || @116333  Sir I m very sorry to say I m very very disappointed with Mac Book pro service,as I m using all apple devices but this Mac Book is creating problems in regular basis, I want apple has to exchange it otherwise I will stop buying apple products &amp; go to consumer forum. || I've concluded that the low end MacMini is a pointless device. It takes me back to the bad days of computing. 10 minutes to finish booting, constant pauses whilst it makes its mind up what to do, spinning colour ball at the slightest mouse click. @115858 can I send it back? || @AppleSupport 
I replaced the GPU on my MBP Late 2011 in 2015 under warranty for free. Well, you solved my problem for some time. And now it happened again. As I know there in no way to repair it for free second time.
I did run Apple Hardware Test but it didn't find any problems. https://t.co/91qqWnMwii
